Description: Orbit Linux: the system's name, version and logo
 Says this system is Orbit Linux, a Debian 13 underneath: os-release (NAME,
 VERSION, BUILD_ID; ID_LIKE=debian), the console's banners, the boot
 menu's name (GRUB_DISTRIBUTOR; the UKIs take theirs from os-release), and
 the logo, as an icon and in ASCII for fastfetch and neofetch, and the
 boot screen (a Plymouth theme, chosen when Plymouth is there). Debian's
 files are diverted, and come back if this package is removed. Installed by
 the Orbit Linux image only: on a Debian with the Orbit desktop, Debian
 stays Debian.
Section: admin
Depends: base-files
Recommends: fastfetch
